														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3693870">
									

<p>Upvoting on potential. I think it needs a bit more than it has, but I like what it has well enough. I don't know if I'd need a narrative, but I'd really like to have a bit more of an idea of its specific behaviors. I like things that are just an anomalous thing, and honestly I liked it even more when it seemed like it was just somehow a predator that had evolved to function on computers, but I still wanted to know how EXACTLY it worked.</p>
<p>Honestly as it is, the thing I can't help feeling is that it's not too clear how this thing is anomalous. It could just be a really advanced bit of image manipulating software. Sure, way more advanced than anything that actually exists today, but give it a decade or so. The only anomaly seems to be that it's able to tell if an animal's alive or not, and a very skilled observer could usually do the same thing.</p>

							</div>

								
					
